Medicine Reminder App – Version 1.0.0

A Flutter-based Android application designed to help users manage their medication schedules.

Features

- Add and manage medicines.
- Set medicine schedules and reminders.
- Receive notifications at scheduled times.
- View medicine-taking history.
- Simple and user-friendly interface.

Download

Download "app-release.apk" from the Assets section below and install it on your Android device.
